<title>BRAZIL: Ships loading/unloading commodities - Brazil ports.</title>
<headline>Ships loading/unloading commodities - Brazil ports.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were loading, unloading or announced on December 10/11 at the Brazilian ports of Santos, Paranagua, Antonina, Maceio and Recife, port authorities said.</p>
